3cword\u003e'[, '\u003cword2\u003e'...]\"\n SO THAT WE ENSURE Vague words in AC descriptions cannot be tested objectively.\n\n## If Validation Fails\nIf `answer: fail`, generate a fix_prompt using this template:\n\nReplace each vague word in the description with specific, measurable\ncriteria.\n\nUse the forbidden_qualifiers list from the architecture reference\n(docs/architecture/architecture.yaml). Replace each forbidden\nqualifier with specific, measurable criteria.\n\n\n## Answer Format\nOutput your answer using this exact format:\n\n=== FILE_START: tmp/2026-08-31-13-49-04-11775/04-96.3-checklist-us-refine-acceptance_criteria-result.yaml ===\nanswer: \u003cpass | fail\u003e\ncontext:\n  - \"\u003cone observation per line\u003e\"\nfix_prompt: |\n  \u003cif answer is fail, provide fix guidance here using template above\u003e\n  \u003cif answer is pass, leave this field empty or omit it\u003e\n=== FILE_END: tmp/2026-08-31-13-49-04-11775/04-96.3-checklist-us-refine-acceptance_criteria-result.yaml ===\n","role":"user"},"session_id":"default"}
